# __NAME__

Game server scaffolded from the [moke-kit create-game](https://github.com/GStones/moke-kit) skill
(aligned with [moke-game/game](https://github.com/moke-game/game) secure defaults).

## Topology

| Entry | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `cmd/__NAME__/service` | Local aggregate: game + AuthModule stub |
| TCP | Opt-in only (`AllWithTCPModule`) — **not** auth-protected |

For production-style split (game-only + remote platform auth), see moke-game/game
`cmd/game0/service-thin` and platform `AuthMiddlewareModule`.

## Run

```bash
cp .env.example .env   # if generated from .env.example.tmpl
docker compose -f ./deployment/docker-compose/infrastructure.yaml up -d
go run ./cmd/__NAME__/service/main.go
```

Public APIs require a bearer token (stub AuthModule). Smoke with auth header:

```bash
curl -s -X POST localhost:8081/v1/hello/hi \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -H 'Authorization: bearer test' \
  -d '{"uid":"10000","message":"hello","topic":"__NAME__"}'
```

Interactive client:

```bash
go run ./cmd/__NAME__/client/main.go grpc
```

Module: `__MODULE__`
